(7549775, 1209337, 67688, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the kind comments . First ribbon after many many years! And on Xmas day too!<br/> <br/>Three things I  have learnt in my DPC years<br/> <br/>1 Getting up early is definitely worth it<br/>2 Never stop shooting and looking for a different angle <br/>3 Never give up !!! <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you for all the kind comments . First ribbon after many many years! And on Xmas day too! Three things I  have learnt in my DPC years 1 Getting up early is definitely worth it2 Never stop shooting and looking for a different angle 3 Never give up !!!  ', '2017-12-25 18:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549848, 1209246, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I learn something new everyday. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Very nice shot. I learn something new everyday. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2017-12-26 15:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549879, 1209337, 24486, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue Ribbon &amp; PB. What a lovely Christmas present</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue Ribbon & PB. What a lovely Christmas present', '2017-12-26 22:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550077, 1209164, 72708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cyrilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot but not what I would call isolation of color. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I disagree - the challenge was Isolation by Contrast. Contrast and color are not the same thing. I think this was excellent at addressing the theme. Terrific image.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cyrilda: Great shot but not what I would call isolation of color.   I disagree - the challenge was Isolation by Contrast. Contrast and color are not the same thing. I think this was excellent at addressing the theme. Terrific image.', '2017-12-28 07:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550120, 1209164, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats... lots of contrast here. Love the blue and orange and the subjects against/amongst the nature. Great picture!</td>', 'Congrats... lots of contrast here. Love the blue and orange and the subjects against/amongst the nature. Great picture!', '2017-12-28 17:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550389, 1209279, 29011, '<td valign="top">Good one! :) A very fun pick me up.</td>', 'Good one! :) A very fun pick me up.', '2017-12-30 21:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7551013, 1209337, 136989, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>What to say regarding a Blue Ribbon entry ... Congratulations!!  Clearly everyone agrees that you isolated your subject and used great contrast to show it in its best light (quite literally).  Getting up early is hard but I''m very glad you did so that we could see this beautiful vista.  I love the transition of day and night captured in such rich colors. I even like that the peak is centered in the composition.  I know some folks frown on that but this just works.  <br/> <br/>Congratulations again on the little blue Christmas present.  You''ve earned it and encouraged me to make plans for early Saturday morning with my camera.  ;)<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! What to say regarding a Blue Ribbon entry ... Congratulations!!  Clearly everyone agrees that you isolated your subject and used great contrast to show it in its best light (quite literally).  Getting up early is hard but I''m very glad you did so that we could see this beautiful vista.  I love the transition of day and night captured in such rich colors. I even like that the peak is centered in the composition.  I know some folks frown on that but this just works.   Congratulations again on the little blue Christmas present.  You''ve earned it and encouraged me to make plans for early Saturday morning with my camera.  ;)', '2018-01-04 11:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
